        "filing_date": "2026-02-13",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over time, we believe we can continue to grow NOI and strategic capital revenues organically and through accretive development and acquisition activity while further reducing G&A as a percentage of our investments in real estate.",
